    <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/45a5094d-9637-4b24-a517-f7455aa68c32-01/FrameworkAgreementTerm$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingProcess1>,
    <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/45a5094d-9637-4b24-a517-f7455aa68c32-01/MultipleStageProcedureTerm$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1>,
